{
    "title": "Blood Pressure App & Tracker",
    "description": "Blood Pressure App & Tracker is your reliable assistant in recording blood pressure data and find BP info. You can easily record, monitor your blood pressure, blood sugar, heart rate and track BP trends for free.\r\n                                                                                \r\n\ud83d\udd0d Highlight features of the Blood Pressure Tracker:\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Keep daily blood pressure records\r\n- Enter blood pressure data based on three values: Systolic (SYS), Diastolic (DIA), and Pulse.\r\n- Blood pressure tracking graphs: Observe your blood pressure data trends and history.\r\n- Grasp your BP condition fully under different states with custom tags (lying, sitting, before/after meal, etc.). \r\n- Please note that this app DOES NOT measure blood pressure.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Blood Sugar\r\n- Easy to record and track your blood glucose levels (Type 1, Type 2, or diabetes).\r\n- Use or switch two different blood glucose level units (mg/dl or mmol/l).\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Heart rate\r\n- Record your heart rate in the app and track heart rate changes through detailed graphs.\r\n- This app uses your phone's camera to capture the color difference of the blood flowing through your finger to estimate your heart rate per minute and uses an algorithm to record the heartbeat.\r\n- Users can view daily, weekly or monthly health reports to understand their physical condition.\r\n- If you need professional heart rate detection, please use professional medical equipment.\r\n                                                                                     \r\n\ud83c\udf1f Provides information about your BMI and health\r\n- Users can enter weight and height data into the application. Following that, this app will provide the BMI result. \r\n- Provide health knowledge about blood pressure, blood sugar, heart rate,...\r\n                                                                               \r\n\ud83c\udf1f Smart Alarm and Food Scanner\r\n- Quickly scan barcodes on fast food to see if it's healthy.\r\n- Set an alarm to receive notifications when it is time to take your medication, check your blood pressure, or engage in physical activity.\r\n                                                                                \r\n\ud83d\udc49 Download Blood Pressure App & Tracker now to record, track blood pressure, blood sugar data effectively and maintain good health.\r\n\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f Disclaimer: \r\n- Blood Pressure App does not measure your blood pressure, blood sugar, and is not intended for medical emergencies. Consult your doctor if you need any help.\r\n- The application is not intended to replace professional medical equipment or other blood pressure monitoring devices. \r\n- The information we provide is only for reference purposes. Our app does not provide health professional guidance. If you require health professional guidance, please consult a professional medical provider or physician.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Blood Pressure App &amp; Tracker is your reliable assistant in recording blood pressure data and find BP info. You can easily record, monitor your blood pressure, blood sugar, heart rate and track BP trends for free.<br>                                                                                <br>\ud83d\udd0d Highlight features of the Blood Pressure Tracker:<br>\ud83c\udf1f Keep daily blood pressure records<br>- Enter blood pressure data based on three values: Systolic (SYS), Diastolic (DIA), and Pulse.<br>- Blood pressure tracking graphs: Observe your blood pressure data trends and history.<br>- Grasp your BP condition fully under different states with custom tags (lying, sitting, before/after meal, etc.). <br>- Please note that this app DOES NOT measure blood pressure.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Blood Sugar<br>- Easy to record and track your blood glucose levels (Type 1, Type 2, or diabetes).<br>- Use or switch two different blood glucose level units (mg/dl or mmol/l).<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Heart rate<br>- Record your heart rate in the app and track heart rate changes through detailed graphs.<br>- This app uses your phone&#39;s camera to capture the color difference of the blood flowing through your finger to estimate your heart rate per minute and uses an algorithm to record the heartbeat.<br>- Users can view daily, weekly or monthly health reports to understand their physical condition.<br>- If you need professional heart rate detection, please use professional medical equipment.<br>                                                                                     <br>\ud83c\udf1f Provides information about your BMI and health<br>- Users can enter weight and height data into the application. Following that, this app will provide the BMI result. <br>- Provide health knowledge about blood pressure, blood sugar, heart rate,...<br>                                                                               <br>\ud83c\udf1f Smart Alarm and Food Scanner<br>- Quickly scan barcodes on fast food to see if it&#39;s healthy.<br>- Set an alarm to receive notifications when it is time to take your medication, check your blood pressure, or engage in physical activity.<br>                                                                                <br>\ud83d\udc49 Download Blood Pressure App &amp; Tracker now to record, track blood pressure, blood sugar data effectively and maintain good health.<br><br>\u26a0\ufe0f Disclaimer: <br>- Blood Pressure App does not measure your blood pressure, blood sugar, and is not intended for medical emergencies. Consult your doctor if you need any help.<br>- The application is not intended to replace professional medical equipment or other blood pressure monitoring devices. <br>- The information we provide is only for reference purposes. Our app does not provide health professional guidance. If you require health professional guidance, please consult a professional medical provider or physician.",
